extends includes/layout.pug
block vars
  - var currentPage = "homeowners"

block content
  .intro.py-3
    .container
      .row.align-items-start.py-2.py-md-3
        .col-md-6.order-md-1.d-flex.justify-content-center.justify-content-md-end
          .image-with-overlay.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img9.jpg", alt="image description", width="435", height="223")
        .col-md-6.text-center.text-md-start
          h2.text-info Homeowners Insurance
          p Insurance rates keep rising in Florida. But you can still find affordable coverage to protect your home from disaster. Our local agents find customized policies to fit your home and budget. Cover your home in case of fire, hurricanes, legal action, theft and more.
  section.py-3
    .container
      .row.justify-content-center.pt-md-3.pb-3.pb-md-5
        .col-md-10
          article.text-center.font-md-large.px-md-4_5
            h2.text-primary What Does Homeowners Insurance in Florida Cover?
            p A lot of different things can happen to your home and Florida faces some unique challenges. Here are some of the most common categories for homeowners coverage in Florida.
      .graphic__list
        .graphic__list__item
          span.icon__with__circle
            img(src="assets/images/icons/icon23.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
          .graphic__list__title-holder
            .graphic__list__title.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm
              h3.h5.text-uppercase.mb-0 Dwelling
          .graphic__list__content.border.border-3.border-md-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.font-md-large
            p If your property structure is damaged or destroyed, dwelling insurance covers your investment.
        .graphic__list__item
          span.icon__with__circle
            img(src="assets/images/icons/icon24.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
          .graphic__list__title-holder
            .graphic__list__title.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm
              h3.h5.text-uppercase.mb-0 Personal Property
          .graphic__list__content.border.border-3.border-md-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.font-md-large
            p You might be surprised how much it costs to replace your belongings. Furniture, appliances, clothing, and treasures.
        .graphic__list__item
          span.icon__with__circle
            img(src="assets/images/icons/icon25.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
          .graphic__list__title-holder
            .graphic__list__title.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm
              h3.h5.text-uppercase.mb-0 Liability
          .graphic__list__content.border.border-3.border-md-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.font-md-large
            p When someone is injured on your property, you are liable for potential medical bills and legal costs. Liability coverage protects you from these unexpected liabilities. And helps injured parties get the care they need.
        .graphic__list__item
          span.icon__with__circle
            img(src="assets/images/icons/icon26.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
          .graphic__list__title-holder
            .graphic__list__title.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm
              h3.h5.text-uppercase.mb-0 Loss of Use
          .graphic__list__content.border.border-3.border-md-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.font-md-large
            p If your home is damaged, you may need to move out during repairs. Moving quickly can be expensive and traumatic for the whole family. Loss of use coverage offsets the financial burden from living away from home during a claim.
        .graphic__list__item
          span.icon__with__circle
            img(src="assets/images/icons/icon27.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
          .graphic__list__title-holder
            .graphic__list__title.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm
              h3.h5.text-uppercase.mb-0 Water Damage
          .graphic__list__content.border.border-3.border-md-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.font-md-large
            p Failed plumbing and burst pipes are a common cause of disaster in the home. Water damage coverage insures your home against massive unexpected costs from water damage. Flood insurance is treated differently in Florida due to hurricane risks and heavy rainfall. Ask your GreatFlorida agent about flood insurance requirements and recommendations.
        .graphic__list__item
          span.icon__with__circle
            img(src="assets/images/icons/icon28.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
          .graphic__list__title-holder
            .graphic__list__title.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm
              h3.h5.text-uppercase.mb-0= "Hurricane & Windstorm Damage"
          .graphic__list__content.border.border-3.border-md-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.font-md-large
            p The most feared season among Florida homeowners, hurricane season spans half the year. Hurricane and windstorm coverage gives you peace of mind when summer rolls around.
        .graphic__list__item
          span.icon__with__circle
            img(src="assets/images/icons/icon29.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
          .graphic__list__title-holder
            .graphic__list__title.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm
              h3.h5.text-uppercase.mb-0 Loss Assessment
          .graphic__list__content.border.border-3.border-md-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.font-md-large
            p A valuable add-on for homes with an HOA. Loss assessment protects against claims on shared property, covering you against unexpected expenses.
  article.bg-primary.text-white.overflow-hidden.pt-3.pt-md-0
    .container
      .row.justify-content-between
        .col-md-5.order-md-1.d-flex.justify-content-center.justify-content-md-end.position-relative
          .image-with-overlay.image-bleed.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img.img-fluid(src="assets/images/img10.jpg", alt="image description", width="435", height="223")
        .col-md-6.text-center.text-md-start.py-3.py-md-5
          h2 High Value Home insurance
          p Your beautiful luxury home is special. And it needs high-value homeowners insurance to protect it. Most policy limits do not cover the cost to repair or rebuild a luxury home. High value home insurance ensures you don't lose your precious investment.
  section.py-3
    .container
      .row.align-items-start.py-3.py-md-5
        .col-md-6.d-flex.justify-content-center.justify-content-md-start
          .image-with-overlay.overlay--blue.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img11.jpg", alt="image description", width="435", height="223")
        .col-md-6.text-center.text-md-end
          h2.text-info Is Hurricane Damage Covered by Homeowners Insurance?
          p Hurricane coverage is not a separate insurance policy. But not all homeowners insurance policies cover it. In hurricane heavy Florida, hurricane insurance is a crucial part of protecting your home. Talk to your GreatFlorida agent about hurricane coverage to feel peace of mind when storm season rolls in.
  section.py-3
    .container
      .row.justify-content-center.py-3.pb-md-5
        .col-md-11
          .text-center.font-md-large.px-2.px-sm-4_5
            h2.text-info Is Hurricane Damage is Covered By My Homeowners Policy?
      .row.gx-lg-2
        .col-sm-6.col-lg-3.d-flex.mb-4.mb-lg-0
          article.card-type-content
            .preview.image-with-overlay.overlay--blue.border.border-2.border-info.rounded
              img(src="assets/images/img25.jpg", alt="image description", width="575", height="573")
            .px-2_5.flex-grow-1
              .content-with-icon.bg-info.text-white.rounded-sm.h-100
                .icon
                  img(src="assets/images/icons/icon30.svg", alt="image description", width="70", height="70")
                h3.h5.text-uppercase Wind
                p Wind is generally covered under homeowners insurance policies. But you must check with your agents if your home is protected during hurricanes and named storms.
        .col-sm-6.col-lg-3.d-flex.mb-4.mb-lg-0
          article.card-type-content
            .preview.image-with-overlay.overlay--orange.border.border-2.border-primary.rounded
              img(src="assets/images/img26.jpg", alt="image description", width="242", height="312")
            .px-2_5.flex-grow-1
              .content-with-icon.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm.h-100
                .icon
                  img(src="assets/images/icons/icon31.svg", alt="image description", width="70", height="70")
                h3.h5.text-uppercase Flooding
                p Homeowners insurance generally does not cover flood insurance caused by hurricanes. Ask your agents about Florida's flood insurance requirements and recommendations to keep your home protected.
        .col-sm-6.col-lg-3.d-flex.mb-4.mb-lg-0
          article.card-type-content
            .preview.image-with-overlay.overlay--blue.border.border-2.border-info.rounded
              img(src="assets/images/img27.jpg", alt="image description", width="386", height="529")
            .px-2_5.flex-grow-1
              .content-with-icon.bg-info.text-white.rounded-sm.h-100
                .icon
                  img(src="assets/images/icons/icon32.svg", alt="image description", width="70", height="70")
                h3.h5.text-uppercase Sewage
                p ot included in many homeowners insurance polices. Sewage protection can be added to policies, covering the possibility of back up from high rainfall and named-storms.
        .col-sm-6.col-lg-3.d-flex.mb-4.mb-lg-0
          article.card-type-content
            .preview.image-with-overlay.overlay--orange.border.border-2.border-primary.rounded
              img(src="assets/images/img28.jpg", alt="image description", width="413", height="529")
            .px-2_5.flex-grow-1
              .content-with-icon.bg-primary.text-white.rounded-sm.h-100
                .icon
                  img(src="assets/images/icons/icon33.svg", alt="image description", width="70", height="70")
                h3.h5.text-uppercase Evacuation
                p Evacuation coverage is very policy dependent. Talk to your agent about coverage options for evacuation.
  section.py-3
    .container
      .row.align-items-start.py-3.py-md-5
        .col-md-6.order-md-1.d-flex.justify-content-center.justify-content-md-end
          .image-with-overlay.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img12.jpg", alt="image description", width="435", height="223")
        .col-md-6.text-center.text-md-start
          h2.text-info How Do Hurricane Deductibles Work?
          p If your homeowners insurance includes hurricane or named-storm damage, separate deductibles may apply. This may be higher than your standard homeowners policy deductible, so you need to know what to expect in advance. Your hurricane deductible may be a percentage of your insured value. Talk to an agent about finding the best cost-effective policy to protect your home from storms.
  section.py-3
    .container
      .row.justify-content-center.py-3.pb-md-5
        .col-md-10
          .text-center.font-md-large.px-2.px-sm-4_5
            h2.text-info Factors That Affect Home Insurance Premiums
            p Your premium will reflect the risk your house carries of suffering a disaster. The following factors can affect the rates you are offered:
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img13.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon34.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | Age of the house

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p An older house may have deteriorating plumbing and structural issues. This can increase the price of your homeowners insurance.
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img14.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon35.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | Type of structure

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p The cost to insure your home varies depending on the materials it is made from. A larger or more expensive structure will cost more to rebuild.
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img15.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon36.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | WIRING AND PLUMBING

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p Older wiring and plumbing pose a greater risk for fire or water damage.
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img16.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon37.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | LOCATION

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p If your neighborhood has a high crime rate or is prone to natural disasters, you can expect to pay higher rates
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img17.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon38.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | FIRE SAFETY

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p Poor fire safety increases the risk of disaster. But living near to a hydrant or fire house can actually decrease your premiums.
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img18.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon39.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | PURPOSE

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p If you run a business from your home, your risk of lawsuits is higher due to theft, liability, and damage. This can increase your premiums.
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img19.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon40.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | PERSONAL FACTORS

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p Smoking or owning a dog can increase your insurance rates as your risk level increases. Your marital status can also affect your premium. Married couples enjoy the lowest rates.
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img20.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon41.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | DEDUCTIBLE

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p The higher the deductible you choose for your policy, the lower your premium will be. Ask your GreatFlorida agent about balancing premium affordability with your ability to pay a highder deductible.
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img21.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon42.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | CLAIMS HISTORY

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p If you have a history of making claims, your rates will be higher. Insurers view homeowners with previous claims as higher risk.
      .auto-factors__item.row.g-0
        .auto-factors__col.col-lg-3.mb-2.mb-lg-0.d-none.d-lg-block
          .image-with-overlay.image-with-overlay--small.border.border-4.border-primary.rounded-sm.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img22.jpg", alt="image description", width="251", height="141")
        .auto-factors__col.auto-factors__col--middle.col-md-6.col-lg-4
          .pill__heading.pill__heading--with-icon
            span.icon__with__circle
              img(src="assets/images/icons/icon43.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
            | CREDIT HISTORY

        .auto-factors__col.col-md-5.col-lg-4
          .auto-factors__description.border.border-4.border-info.rounded-sm.text-center
            p A higher credit score can help reduce your homeowners insurance rates in Florida. Some risk factors are out of your control, but improving your credit score is an easy way to save money on premiums.
  article.bg-info.text-white.overflow-hidden.pt-3.pt-md-0
    .container
      .row.justify-content-between
        .col-md-5.order-md-1.d-flex.justify-content-center.justify-content-md-end.position-relative
          .image-with-overlay.image-bleed.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img.img-fluid(src="assets/images/img23.jpg", alt="image description", width="435", height="223")
        .col-md-6.text-center.text-md-start.py-3.py-md-5
          h2 Types of Home Insurance Coverage in Florida
          p Your insurance policy should cover 100% of the cost to rebuild your home. Not carrying enough insurance can leave you at risk of financial ruin.
          p Speak to your insurance agent to determine the type of coverage your home needs. They can determine the correct coverage for:
          .row.pt-3
            .col-4.d-flex.flex-column.align-items-center.text-center.mb-3
              span.icon__with__circle.mb-4
                img(src="assets/images/icons/icon44.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
              h3.h5.mb-0 Actual Cash Value
            .col-4.d-flex.flex-column.align-items-center.text-center.mb-3
              span.icon__with__circle.mb-4
                img(src="assets/images/icons/icon45.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
              h3.h5.mb-0 Replacement Cost
            .col-4.d-flex.flex-column.align-items-center.text-center.mb-3
              span.icon__with__circle.mb-4
                img(src="assets/images/icons/icon46.svg", width="87", alt="image description")
              h3.h5.mb-0 Extended Value
  article.py-3
    .container
      .row.align-items-start.py-3.py-md-5
        .col-md-6.d-flex.justify-content-center.justify-content-md-start
          .image-with-overlay.mb-3.mb-md-0
            img(src="assets/images/img24.jpg", alt="image description", width="435", height="223")
        .col-md-6.text-center.text-md-end
          h2.text-info How Much Do Florida Home Insurance Premiums Cost?
          p Florida homeowners insurance is much higher than the national average. Your personal rate depends on many factors. And navigating the coverage can be overwhelming. Talk to your agent about your specific circumstances to get the ideal coverage and peace of mind.
  //  Common Sections for every pages below 
  section.talk-to-block.bg-info.text-white.text-center.font-md-large.py-5.py-md-8
    span.bg-hero
      img(src="assets/images/img-hero.jpg", alt="image description", width="1439", height="695")
    .container.h-100.d-flex.flex-column
      h2 Build Your Own Customized Florida Auto Insurance Policy
      p Your life is unique—your insurance should be too. Work with us to create a bespoke policy that fits your lifestyle, budget, and coverage needs. Our agents compare policies and rates from top insurers, ensuring you get comprehensive protection at an affordable price.
      .flex-grow-1.d-flex.justify-content-center.align-items-center
        a.btn.btn-primary.text-uppercase(href="#") talk to a Greatflorida Agent